To my huge relief the cherry trees of Pristan were spared from the Flying Turkey's attacks.{pause}

I wouldn't want to be in Yorik's shoes right now. His defeat at Vostok will be nothing compared to the retaliation Kharkan will inflict on his family members. The Katzars are less afraid of their enemies than of the Katzar-Khat Fedor Kharkan himself.{pause}

Do you happen to know the recipe for Turkey à la Zirgol? It's for dinner every day of this week.{pause}

Despite the effectiveness of my TSUNAMI strategy, Yorik the Turkey and Natkrof the Zirgol have succeeded in sinking their dirty fingernails into two Nikonese islands: {arialbld}Surimi and Wazabi{arial}. They've armed these into reefs of cannons.{pause}


I've got a surprise for you {rank}. By my orders, Schyzo engineers from Naval Aviation have successfully adapted the "Pelikan" bombers for take-off from aircraft carriers. If the impact of this news hasn't hit you, let me refresh your memory about the features of "Pelikan" bombers:{pause}









